Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here's what people
are talking about.

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
The big story
is still Trump's physical.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.938 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:07.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which he passed with
flying colors.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Surprisingly, yeah.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of people were very
skeptical when they heard that

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.546 line:92%
Trump only weighs 239 pounds.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.080 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
