about a North Korean missile.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then the guy who sent it said,
"yeah, I might have lied

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:45.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
"about why I left my last job
in Hawaii. Sorry!

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
Uh, Oops! Sorry!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:50.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
Listen to this, I saw that
the UK just appointed

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.240 line:92%
a Minister of Loneliness.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:54.974 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:56.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
The UK just appointed
a Minister of Loneliness.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:59.646
Yeah. To deal with the sad
reality of modern life. Yeah.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:04.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
Minister of Loneliness.
As if Morrissey wasn't enough.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.485 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:08.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
They named him
Minister of Loneliness.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
