00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:23.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
Finally, I want to say --
You liked that Morrissey one?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, I know, thank you,
thank you.

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:26.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was classic.
It was classic.

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:29.776
